      "short": "Sets cannot contain duplicate elements; red appears four times.",
      "worked": "Each element of a set is listed only once. Geri has repeated red four times and green twice. The set should be $A=\\{\\text{green},\\text{purple},\\text{pink},\\text{red},\\text{blue},\\text{orange}\\}$.",
